    "差出人・件名・本文から、すべてのアカウントを横断して検索します。\n「from:」「to:」「cc:」「subject:」でヘッダを絞り込めます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searches sender, subject, and body across every account.\nUse “from:”, “to:”, “cc:”, or “subject:” to narrow by header."
          }
