      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Also Show Avatars in Message View"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧・表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "List & Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "プロフィールアイコンは差出人のイニシャルとアカウント色から生成され、外部サービスへの問い合わせは一切行いません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avatars are generated from the sender's initials and the account's color — no external service is ever contacted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "常にテキストで表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Show as Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メールの表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Message Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTMLメールを既定でテキスト表示にします。メール詳細画面の切替ボタンで、メールごとに一時的に戻すこともできます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows HTML messages as plain text by default. You can switch back for an individual message using the toggle button in the message view."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "埋め込み画像を自動表示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Show Embedded Images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "リモート画像を自動で読み込む": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Load Remote Images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画像": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "埋め込み画像はメールに直接添付・埋め込まれた画像（cid: インライン画像・画像添付）です。リモート画像は外部サーバーから読み込む画像で、自動で読み込むと送信者にメールを開いたことが伝わる場合があります（開封トラッキング）。いずれもオフの場合は、メール詳細画面の「画像を表示」ボタンでそのメールだけ一時的に表示できます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedded images are attached directly inside the message (cid: inline images and image attachments). Remote images load from an external server, and loading them automatically can let the sender know you opened the message (open tracking). With either off, you can still show images for a single message using the “Show Images” button in the message view."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリ内ブラウザ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In-App Browser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "デフォルトブラウザ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default Browser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "リンク": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Links"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "メール本文内のリンクをタップしたときに、アプリ内のブラウザで開くか、端末のデフォルトブラウザで開くかを選べます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose whether tapping a link in a message opens it in the in-app browser or your device's default browser."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "既定ではピン留めはこの端末・このアプリだけのローカルな印です。ONにすると、ピン留め/解除のたびに IMAP の \\Flagged フラグも更新し、他のメールクライアントでのフラグ操作も読み取ってピン留めに反映します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default, pinning is a local marker for this app on this device only. When on, pinning/unpinning also updates the IMAP \\Flagged flag, and flag changes made in other mail clients are reflected back as pins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "サーバーのフラグ (\\Flagged) と連動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync with Server Flag (\\Flagged)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "表示言語": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アプリの表示言語を切り替えます。変更を反映するには、アプリを再起動してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switches the app's display language. Restart the app for the change to take effect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "英文を自動で翻訳": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Translate English Messages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一覧に要約を出す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Summaries in List"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻訳は Apple Intelligence により端末内で行われ、外部に送信されません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translation happens on-device via Apple Intelligence and is never sent anywhere else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリについて": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About This App"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "アカウントを削除しますか？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this account?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再認証が必要です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reauthentication Required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再認証": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reauthenticate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "資格情報を待っています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for Credentials"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "パスワードを入力": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter Password"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再認証に失敗しました": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reauthentication failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システムに従う": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Match System"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "日本語": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Japanese"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
